==Description==
'''Angry Pumpkin''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Hexscape Event#Hexscape Event Season Pass|Hexscape Event Season]]. It was obtained at Level 4 of the premium track, which costed {{CandyCorns|100 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|38}} ({{Robux|28}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale) to unlock. It had a total cost of {{CandyCorns|250 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|140}} ({{Robux|114}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale).

==Appearance==
This sticker showcases an orange pumpkin with an angry face. It plays the default sound when used.

==Trivia==
*The sound that plays when using the '''Angry Pumpkin''' sticker originates from ''Undertale''.
*This sticker is most likely a reference to the [https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/i-am-the-angry-pumpkin-the-architect-and-the-builder I Am The Angry Pumpkin] meme.

